;; source_line: 526467
(#$ist #$FinancialTransactionMt (#$comment #$dilutionLevy "A #$MeasurableQuantitySlot that relates an #$ExchangeOfUserRights to a #$MonetaryValue. (#$dilutionLevy EXCHANGE AMOUNT) means that the dilution levy on EXCHANGE is AMOUNT. A dilution levy is a fee that OEICs (see #$OpenEndedInvestmentCompany) often charge on large deals that may be disadvantageous to earnings."))
