(#$ist #$FinancialTransactionMt (#$comment #$corpSharePercentPriceRiseSinceLastClose "A #$NumericIntervalSlot and #$TimeDependentRelation that relates a #$LegalCorporation to a #$RealNumber. <code>(#$percentChangeInSharePriceSinceLastClose CORP N)</code> means that the price of a share in CORP has changed by N% since the last close of the relevant market. <p> For example, <code>(#$percentChangeInSharePriceSinceLastClose #$GoogleInc -0.94)</code> means that the price of a share in Google, Inc. has dropped by 0.94% since the last close of the relevant market (viz. NASDAQ)."))
;; source_line: 669466
