(#$ist #$FinancialTransactionMt (#$comment #$corpSharePriceAtLastClose "A #$MeasurableQuantitySlot and #$TimeDependentRelation that relates a #$LegalCorporation to a #$MonetaryValue. <code>(#$corpSharePriceAtLastClose CORP PRICE)</code> means that the price of a share of stock in <code>CORP</code> was <code>PRICE</code> at the most recent close of the relevant market."))
